{"id":3264,"date":"2017-02-12T13:01:32","date_gmt":"2017-02-12T20:01:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=3264"},"modified":"2017-02-12T13:01:32","modified_gmt":"2017-02-12T20:01:32","slug":"the-pony-express-very-impressive","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/02\/12\/the-pony-express-very-impressive\/","title":{"rendered":"The Pony Express &#8211; Very Impressive"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Kathy and I took another &#8220;day trip&#8221; this past week. \u00a0This is just one of the wonderful things about our location (Camp Verde) in Arizona. \u00a0There is so much to see and so many different landscapes within just a short drive in the car.<\/p>\n<p>This time we decided to head east and then north a bit into &#8220;high country&#8221; to see some snow and check out the towns we see mentioned on the 6 o&#8217;clock news weather report.<\/p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" style=\"border: 0;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/embed?pb=!1m46!1m12!1m3!1d842806.3419164289!2d-111.49852352047134!3d34.39595011458374!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!4m31!3e0!4m5!1s0x872c10dd6a3e1a7d%3A0x8de0f8fc583ada2f!2sPayson%2C+AZ!3m2!1d34.2308684!2d-111.3251355!4m5!1s0x872c555ea76722fd%3A0x58a7f8b6da12b349!2sCamp+Verde%2C+AZ+86322!3m2!1d34.5636358!2d-111.85431779999999!4m5!1s0x872f2905cd3521f7%3A0xc60fd8f7ee55d508!2sShow+Low%2C+AZ!3m2!1d34.254208399999996!2d-110.0298327!4m5!1s0x872f3c5a7ae9d803%3A0xb640425546bb2730!2sSnowflake%2C+AZ!3m2!1d34.5133698!2d-110.0784491!4m5!1s0x872c555ea76722fd%3A0x58a7f8b6da12b349!2sCamp+Verde%2C+AZ!3m2!1d34.5636358!2d-111.85431779999999!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1486857442768\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>Our elevation here at Camp Verde is 3146&#8242; while Payson is at 4890&#8242; and Show Low is at 6345&#8242; above sea level. \u00a0It was a 65 degree afternoon here while in Show Low the high that afternoon barely got to 50 degrees.<\/p>\n<p>We checked out the lake and the dam at Show Low Lake, we visited the <a href=\"http:\/\/azwildlifetrails.com\/northeastern-arizona-wildlife-trails\/pintail-lake-allen-severson-wildlife-area\/\">Allen Severson Wetland area<\/a>, and stopped to check out a really cool store with a lot of woodcarvings \u00a0and beautiful hand crafted furniture. \u00a0The store was called <a href=\"https:\/\/www.yelp.com\/biz\/wild-woods-show-low\" target=\"_blank\">Wild Woods Furniture and Gifts<\/a>.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-3264 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-15.25.14.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-15.25.14.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3266\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-15.25.14.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-15.25.14-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-15.25.14-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-15.25.14-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3266'>\n\t\t\t\tOutside display\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-15.24.52.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-15.24.52.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describe