m\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-14.05.21.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-14.05.21.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3286\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-14.05.21.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-14.05.21-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-14.05.21-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-14.05.21-1024x768.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3286'>\n\t\t\t\tOn the trail at Allen Severson Wildlife Area\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-13.32.44.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-13.32.44.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3287\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-13.32.44.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-13.32.44-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-13.32.44-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-13.32.44-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3287'>\n\t\t\t\tMarsh area at Allen Severson Wildlife area\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-13.32.33.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-13.32.33.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3288\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-13.32.33.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-13.32.33-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-13.32.33-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-13.32.33-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3288'>\n\t\t\t\tAnother view of the marsh\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-12.49.45.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-12.49.45.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3289\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-12.49.45.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-12.49.45-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-12.49.45-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-12.49.45-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3289'>\n\t\t\t\tShow Low Dam\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-12.48.42.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-12.48.42.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3290\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-12.48.42.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-12.48.42-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-12.48.42-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/02\/2017-02-08-12.48.42-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3290'>\n\t\t\t\tShow Low Lake\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>But the best part of the trip came totally by surprise. \u00a0As we were headed back west from Snowflake to Payson, we came across men on horseback escorted by police along state routes. \u00a0I remembered seeing a story on the morning news that this was the week when, every year\u00a0The <a href=\"http:\/\/www.hashknifeponyexpress.com\/\" target=\"_blank\">Hashknife Pony Express<\/a> makes its ride every January\/February traveling 200 miles from Holbrook to Scottsdale, Arizona, and delivering 20,000 first-class letters by horseback. The ride is led by the Navajo County Hashknife Sheriff&#8217;s Posse. More than two dozen riders in authentic cowboy clothing carry the mail, relaying the bags along the route. The ride ends in Scottsdale with the ending ceremony at the <a href=\"http:\/\/scottsdalemuseumwest.org\/\" target=\"_blank\">Museum Of The West<\/a> on Marshall Way.<\/p>\n<p>The video below shows the Hashknife Pony Express just taking off again after a short rest at a local shopping mall parking lot. \u00a0Cowboy hats, chaps, boots, and spurs &#8230;<\/p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/BElpe5UMHI8\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Kathy and I took another &#8220;day trip&#8221; this past week. \u00a0This is just one of the wonderful things about our location (Camp Verde) in Arizona. \u00a0There is so much to see and so many different landscapes within just a short drive in the car. This time we decided to head east and then north a &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/02\/12\/the-pony-express-very-impressive\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">The Pony Express &#8211; Very Impressive<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[490,19546],"tags":[554707282,24592,554707283,554707292,554707290,554707293,554707251,554707288,554707284,554707286,404643,554707285,554707294,554707291,554707280,554707281,554707289,554707287],"class_list":["post-3264","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-animals","category-sightseeing","tag-aliens","tag-arizona","tag-bears","tag-chaps","tag-cowboy","tag-cowboy-boots","tag-ducks","tag-geese","tag-horses","tag-marsh","tag-payson","tag-pony-express","tag-rustic-furniture","tag-saddle","tag-show-low","tag-snowflake","tag-water-fowl","tag-wildlife-area"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3264","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3264"}],"version-history":[{"count":7,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3264\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3296,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3264\/revisions\/3296"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=3264"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=3264"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=3264"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}